{"id": "section-body-26490", "title": "Suicide", "chapterId": "chapter-twenty-three", "blocks": [{"id": "body-26490", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading2", "text": "Suicide", "runs": [{"text": "Suicide"}], "level": 2, "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "381"}}, {"id": "body-26492", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Patients with concomitant medical illness, e.g. heart disease, epilepsy", "runs": [{"text": "Patients with concomitant medical illness, e.g. heart "}, {"text": "disease, epilepsy"}], "list": {"level": 2, "numberingId": "381"}}, {"id": "body-26493", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Poor social support systems", "runs": [{"text": "Poor"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "social"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "support"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "systems"}], "list": {"level": 2, "numberingId": "381"}}, {"id": "body-26494", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Pregnancy and lactation", "runs": [{"text": "Pregnancy"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "lactation"}], "list": {"level": 2, "numberingId": "381"}}, {"id": "body-26496", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Suicide is the act of deliberately killing oneself and is a serious public health problem affecting families, communities and entire countries. Suicides are preventable with timely, evidence-based and often low-cost intervention.", "runs": [{"text": "Suicide"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "act"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "deliberately"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "killing"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "oneself"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "serious"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "public"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "health"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "problem"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "affecting"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "families,"}, {"text":