" "}, {"text": "attempts."}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "363"}}, {"id": "body-26523", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Look out for signs of poisoning or intoxication, loss of consciousness, bleeding from self-inflicted wounds or extreme lethargy.", "runs": [{"text": "Look"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "out"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "signs"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "poisoning"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "intoxication,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "loss"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "consciousness,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "bleeding"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "from"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "self-inflicted"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "wounds"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "extreme"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "lethargy."}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "363"}}, {"id": "body-26524", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Previous history of self-harm/suicidal thoughts or plans in the past two weeks –one year. For a person who is extremely agitated, violent, distressed or lacks communication, inquire if, in the past two weeks to one month, they have had thoughts or plans to self-harm/suicidal ideations, or if in the past year, they have self-harmed.", "runs": [{"text": "Previous"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "history"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "self-harm/suicidal"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "thoughts"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "plans"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "past"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "two"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "weeks"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "–one"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "year."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "For"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "person"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "who"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "extremely"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "agitated, violent, distressed or lacks communication, inquire if, in the past two weeks to one month, they have had thoughts or plans to self-harm/suicidal ideations, or if in the past year, they have self-harmed."}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "363"}}, {"id": "body-26525", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Presence of mental, neurological & substance abuse (MNS) conditions, e.g., depression, child & adolescent mental and behavioral disorders, psychoses, disorders due to substance use, epilepsy, and chronic pain.", "runs": [{"text": "Presence of mental, neurological & substance abuse (MNS) conditions, e.g., depression, child & adolescent mental and behavioral disorders, psychoses, disorders due to substance use, epilepsy, and chronic pain."}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "363"}}, {"id": "body-26526", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Severity of emotional symptoms:", "runs": [{"text": "Severity"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "emotional"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "symptoms:"}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "363"}}, {"id": "body-26527", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Is the person having difficulty carrying out usual work, school, domestic or social activities?", "runs": [{"text": "Is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "person"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "having"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "difficulty"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "carrying"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "out"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "usual"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "work,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "school,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "domestic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "social"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "activities?"}], "list": {"level": 2, "numberingId": "363"}}, {"id": "body-26528", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Is the person on repeated self-medication for emotional distress or unexplained physical symptoms?", "runs": [{"text": "Is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "person"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "on"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "repeated"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "self-medication"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "emotional"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "distress"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "unexplained"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "physical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "symptoms?"}], "list": {"level": 2, "numberingId": "363"}}, {"id": "body-26529", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Is the person experiencing marked distress or repeated help-seeking behaviour?", "runs": [{"text": "Is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "person"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "experiencing"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "marked"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "distress"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "repeated"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "help-seeking"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "behaviour?"}], "list": {"level": 2, "numberingId": "363"}}, {"id": "body-26530", "type": "paragraph", "style": "Normal", "text": "Management of Suicide", "runs": [{"text": "Management", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "of", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "Suicide", "bold": true}]}, {"id": "body-26531", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Assess the physical condition of the patient to ensure that the patient is medically stable by stabilizing the vital signs and appropriately managing any emergencies.", "runs": [{"text": "Assess"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "physical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "condition"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "patient"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "ensure"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "that"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "patient"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "medically"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "stable"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "by"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "stabilizing"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "vital"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "signs"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and appropriately managing any emergencies."}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "363"}}, {"id": "body-26532", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "When medically stable, calm the patient to do a risk assessment.", "runs": [{"text": "When"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "medically"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "stable,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "calm"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "patient"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "do"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "risk"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "assessment."}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "363"}}, {"id": "body-26533", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Evaluate for underlying psychiatric illness by taking history and mental status examinations.", "runs": [{"text": "Evaluate"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "underlying"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "psychiatric"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "illness"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "by"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "taking"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "history"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "mental"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "status"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "examinations."}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "363"}}, {"id": "body-26534", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "A multidisciplinary approach including the role of physicians in medical management of injuries", "runs": [{"text": "A"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "multidisciplinary"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "approach"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "including"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "role"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "physicians"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "medical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "management"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "injuries"}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "363"}}, {"id": "body-26535", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "It is best to admit the patient for at least 24 hours with strict vigilance to prevent another suicidal attempt or completion.", "runs": [{"text": "It"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "best"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "admit"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "patient"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "at"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "least"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "24"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "hours"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "strict"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "vigilance"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "prevent"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "another"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "suicidal"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "attempt"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "completion."}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "363"}}, {"id": "body-26536", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Remove all potentially harmful objects or means near the patient.", "runs": [{"text": "Remove"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "all"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "potentially"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "harmful"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "objects"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "means"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "near"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "patient."}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "363"}}, {"id": "body-26537", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "All medication given should be supervised.", "runs": [{"text": "All"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "medication"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "given"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "should"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "be"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "supervised."}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "363"}}, {"id": "body-26538", "type": "paragraph", "style": "Normal", "text": "Non-Pharmacological Management", "runs": [{"text": "Non-Pharmacological", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "Management", "bold": true}]}, {"id": "body-26539", "type": "paragraph", "style": "Normal", "text": "This approach can be dual-focused, addressing both the individual and the available caregivers. Ensure the person is placed within a secure and nurturing environment at a healthcare facility (avoid leaving them unattended). Additionally, take measures to eliminate access to potential means of self-harm. If the person must wait for treatment, offer an environment that minimizes distress; if possible, in a separate, quiet room with constant supervision and contact with a designated staff or family member to always ensure safety. Consult a mental health specialist, if available. Offer psychoeducation.", "runs": [{"text": "This approach can be dual-focused, addressing both the individual"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and the available caregivers. Ensure the person is placed within a secure and nurturing environment at a healthcare facility (avoid leaving them unattended). Additionally, take measures to eliminate access"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "potential"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "means"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "self-harm."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "If"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "person"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "must"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "wait"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "treatment,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "offer"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "an"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "environment"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "that"}, {"text": " "}, {"